    "evidence_text": "Ellenbrook, Western Australia\n\nLakeland, Tennessee\nLakeland is a city in Shelby County, Tennessee, and a suburb of Memphis.\n The population was 12,430 at the 2010 census.\n\nMillington, Tennessee\n\nMillington is a city in Shelby County, Tennessee, United States.\n\n Millington is the home of the Memphis International Raceway.\n\n It was granted the title \"Flag City Tennessee\" by the Tennessee State Legislature.\n\n There is also a general aviation airport that features the third longest runway in Tennessee.\n\nCovington, Tennessee\n\n The city is located in West Tennessee, 12 mi east of the Mississippi River.\n\n Located 42 mi northeast of Memphis, Covington is part of the Memphis, Tennessee Metropolitan Area.\n\nMemphis metropolitan area\n\n The census defined combined statistical area covers ten counties in three states \u2013 Tennessee, Mississippi, and Arkansas.\n\n The greater Mid-South area as a whole has a population of 2.4 million according to 2013 census estimates.\n\nMarion, Arkansas\n\n The city is part of the Memphis metropolitan area.\n\n It is the second largest city in Crittenden County, behind West Memphis.\n\nWest Memphis, Arkansas\n\nWest Memphis is the largest city in Crittenden County, Arkansas, United States.\n\n It is part of the Memphis metropolitan area, and is located directly across the Mississippi River from Memphis.\n\nSouthaven, Mississippi\n\nSouthaven is a city in DeSoto County, Mississippi, United States.\n\n It is a suburb of Memphis, Tennessee, and a principal city in the Memphis metropolitan area.\n\n The city's name derives from the fact that Southaven is located south of Whitehaven, a neighborhood in Memphis.\n\nMemphis Hustle\n\n Based in the Memphis suburb of Southaven, Mississippi, the team will play their home games at the Landers Center.\n\nOlive Branch, Mississippi",
